              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Network/external service actions prone to transient failures that lack retry logic.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-in-retry (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules missing-retry` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "Network/external service actions prone to transient failures that lack retry logic.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-in-retry (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules missing-retry` for the full rule description."
